{"id":"d673253336182533","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection.md","title":"ZFC Comb Simultaneous Stationary Reflection","display":"df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection — ZFC Comb Simultaneous Stationary Reflection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection — ZFC Comb Simultaneous Stationary Reflection","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection — ZFC Comb Simultaneous Stationary Reflection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S,\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal S,\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是序数类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}simultaneous\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S(\\mathcal{S},\\kappa,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}simultaneous\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S(\\mathcal{S},\\kappa,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原蕴含式会忽略族中的非驻留成员；同时反射要求每个成员本身在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 上驻留，并在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 上保持驻留。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2$（see [[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是序数类缩写，见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S,\\kappa,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Stationary}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}simultaneous\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCombSimultaneousStationaryReflection}_S(\\mathcal{S},\\kappa,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\land\\alpha\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal S\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S\\cap\\alpha,\\alpha)\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1456,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1645","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection.md|58-df-zfc-comb-simultaneous-stationary-reflection]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["b802c3dd76418d95","5582a281f15a33c2"]}